<title>USA: Palatine, Ill., deal yields 5.625 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Palatine, Ill., deal yields 5.625 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $9.6 million Palatine, Ill., housing bonds to yield 5.625 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>VILLAGE OF PALATINE, ILLINOIS</p>
<p>RE: $9,600,000*</p>
<p>MULTIFAMILY HOUSING REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>(PRARIEBROOK PROJECT)</p>
<p>					     7,195,000*</p>
<p>					 SERIES 1996A BONDS</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>					 FNMA PASS-THROUGH CERTIFICATE</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 06/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	  PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/2026		7,195M    5.625 %	100.00 %</p>
<p>MANDATORY TENDER 12/1/06</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/01/2004    101.50</p>
<p>		   DTP 06/01/2006</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					     2,405,000*</p>
<p>					    SERIES 1996B</p>
<p>THE BONDS ARE TAXABLE MUNICIPAL SECURITIES AND THIS OFFERING IS SUBJECT TO REGULATION BY MUNICIPAL SECURITIES RULE MAKING BOARD.  ALL ACTIVITY UNDERTAKEN WITH RESPECT TO THIS OFFERING MUST BE SUPERVISED BY A MUNICIPAL SECURITY PRINCIPAL.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>					 FNMA PASS-THROUGH CERTIFICATE</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 06/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/2001		  535M	    %</p>
<p>12/01/2006		  770M	    %</p>
<p>12/01/2011		1,100M	    %</p>
<p>				   -------------------------</p>
<p>					TAXABLE INFORMATION</p>
<p> MATURITY	     SPREAD VS TREASURY	APPROX.</p>
<p>			  Years Over		AVER. LIVES</p>
<p>12/01/2001	     +45			 3 YEARS</p>
<p>12/01/2006	     +70			 8 YEARS</p>
<p>12/01/2011	     +80</p>
<p>MANDATORY TENDER 12/1/06</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/01/2004    101.50</p>
<p>		   DTP 06/01/2006</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, November 7, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 26, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
